---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Updates — CMNA"
  description="Corrections, additions, and continuing work around Computational Methods for Numerical Analysis with R."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Living companion</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">What has changed since the book went to press.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        CMNA was published in 2017. The software, examples, corrections, and teaching
        material do not have to stop there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell two-column">
      <article class="content">
        <h2>What belongs here</h2>
        <p>
          This section tracks material that extends or clarifies the published book:
          verified errata, changes to the companion software, improved examples,
          reproducible demonstrations, and teaching notes that are useful enough to
          preserve.
        </p>

        <h2>What this is not</h2>
        <p>
          There is no second edition of CMNA at present. Nor is this page an
          announcement of one. The site is useful on its own as a maintained companion
          to the existing book.
        </p>
        <p>
          Over time, however, the accumulated work can provide a concrete record of
          what has changed, what readers use, and what deserves more treatment. If a
          future edition ever makes sense, that record will be far more useful than
          starting from a blank page.
        </p>

        <h2>Current sources of change</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>verified corrections and clarifications to the 2017 text;</li>
          <li>maintenance and testing of the <code>cmna</code> R package;</li>
          <li>additional method explanations and worked examples;</li>
          <li>teaching material derived from actual use; and</li>
          <li>small companion implementations, including <code>cmna-el</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Errata</h3>
          <p>
            The previous CMNA page records an errata update dated April 3, 2019.
            Those corrections can be consolidated here as the site is populated.
          </p>
          <a href="https://jameshoward.us/books/computational-methods-numerical-analysis-r/">Existing book page →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card aside-card">
          <h3>Software history</h3>
          <p>
            The package repository provides a concrete record of maintenance,
            testing, and changes made after publication.
          </p>
          <a href="https://github.com/k3jph/cmna-pkg">Package repository →</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
